          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "છૂટાછેડા (chūṭācheḍā) is built from chūṭā, \"loosened, apart\", on the stem of છૂટવું (chūṭvũ), \"to get loose\" (CDIAL 3707), and cheḍā, \"ends\": the ends of cloth tied together at a wedding come apart."
